  "description": "In front of Ji-su, who has a thing for chests, stands his childhood friend Jae-hee. Jae-hee’s chest looked soft and firm, and Ji-su can’t stop staring at it. He knows he shouldn’t, but...\n\n*“Hyung, wanna touch my chest?”*\n\nJae-hee, you can’t be doing this! Wait, or maybe... you can?\nJi-su’s love is led by his heart... and his chest!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/S2let_love), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/s2let_love), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066282), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11762973), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250545) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Lezhin](https://lezhin.jp/comic/s2let_love), [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/s2let_love)  \nOthers: [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/Let_love)",
